<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA RECEIVES EBRD LOAN.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA RECEIVES EBRD LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank , the fourth largest bank in Estonia, said on Thursday it has received a subordinated loan from the EBRD for 40 million kroons.</p>
<p>The bank will also receive a syndicated loan of 500 million kroons next week, financial markets head Martti Siimann told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
